        <mxCell id="UC_General-note" value="Complete EPS MVP General Use Case Diagram: all 22 unique use cases (U1-U8, B1-B4, S1-S2, A1-A5, P1-P3) and 7 external actors in one system boundary. Buyer and Seller are transaction-scoped roles; Admin is pre-provisioned; Merchant uses separate client authentication (B1.API / U4.API). B3 includes P1 (funding confirmation) and B4 includes P2 (release via Partner Bank mock); U8 (accepted refund proposal) and A1 (Admin dispute resolution) conditionally invoke P2 / P3." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#172b4d;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="260" y="1735" width="1320" height="110" />
